n fundraising and holds a cash edge in outside support, with no recorded spending against him so far.\n\nRepublican Barb Regnitz has run a serious campaign, raising $2.4 million and earning a Trump endorsement in July, and national GOP groups have promised resources to flip the seat. That investment makes this a competitive race on paper, but with no public polling and a favorable fundamentals picture, Mrvan remains likely to hold on.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9569, "margin": 11.29}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9243, "margin": 9.5}]}